<title>MEXICO: Mexico's January average crude oil prices by type.</title>
<headline>Mexico's January average crude oil prices by type.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's state oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) updated average crude oil prices for January. Below follows a comparative table of prices, by type and region exported.</p>
<p>Type	    Jan. 97	  Dec. 96</p>
<p>America</p>
<p>Maya		18.64	    19.30</p>
<p>Isthmus	   23.20	    23.77</p>
<p>Olmeca	    24.50	    24.97</p>
<p>Europe</p>
<p>Maya		16.66	    19.04</p>
<p>Isthmus	   21.10	    23.02</p>
<p>Far East</p>
<p>Maya		18.54	    19.14</p>
<p>Isthmus	   22.49	    22.79</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
